 gooby’s Joke House\, and performed at the DC Improv for Tony Woods. He ha
 s performed all over the USA including Maryland\, DC\, Virginia\, Pennsylva
 nia\, Utah\, and Hawaii. Spencer also started his own comedy production com
 pany called Frankly Funny Comedy. Selling out shows in both DC and Saltlake
  city Utah. His style and energy can be summed up with how he starts all hi
 s shows\, “Guys! I’m so happy to be here!”\n\nPlease note\, there is 
